/*BLGCHI001-C50: the dark palette is lifted off near-black and every band names its own shade -- measured live: header #16202b (logo art dim), top-menu #111a24, footer #070b10, and the share icons inheriting the dark link color (rgb(105,183,255) glyphs on brand circles). Shades: page #1f2a36, card #293542, header #3a4857, nav #252f3b, footer #1b2530 -- identifiable layers, no deep dark. Icons are brand surfaces and stay out of the mode contract: white glyphs in both modes.*/
html.dark header{background:#3a4857}
html.dark #Header1_headerimg{filter:brightness(1.45) saturate(1.05)}
html.dark .border1menu,html.dark .border2menu,html.dark .border3menu{background:var(--hm-text)}
html.dark #right-header a::before{color:var(--hm-accent)}
html.dark #center-topik2{background:#232e3a}
html.dark #center-topik2 h2,html.dark #center-topik2 h2 span,html.dark #center-topik2 .index-topik{background:#232e3a;color:var(--hm-text)}
html.dark .bagikan-facebook a,html.dark .bagikan-twitter a,html.dark .bagikan-whatsapp a,html.dark .bagikan-threads a,html.dark .bagikan i.fa{color:#fff}
html.dark .copy-to-clipboard{color:#fff}
/*BLGCHI001-C51/C52: the header clusters split -- the two icon controls sit together with no surface of their own, while Trending carries the bubble. C51 measured live: all three controls shared one shadowed pill, the two 34px icon boxes carried a 6px gap (20px between glyphs, centres 40px), and the search anchor inherited `#right-header a` padding 0 8px because id specificity beats `.hm-search-toggle{padding:0}`. C52 (operator) inverted the bubble so the icons read as bare controls beside a labelled pill. Now: 30px boxes + gap 2px (glyph edges 12px, centres 32px), an 8px row gap, .hm-trending-pill holding the white surface + header shadow, the inherited padding/::before reset on the search anchor, and the pill takes its own dark surface (#2a3644) with var(--hm-text) icons under html.dark.*/
#right-header{gap:8px;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;border-radius:0;overflow:visible}
.hm-hdr-icons{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;padding:0;border-radius:0;box-shadow:none;background:none}
#right-header .hm-hdr-icons .hm-dark-toggle,#right-header .hm-hdr-icons a.hm-search-toggle{width:44px;height:44px;margin:0}
#right-header .hm-hdr-icons a.hm-search-toggle{padding:0;background:none;line-height:44px;-webkit-text-fill-color:currentColor;color:#3357a7}
#right-header .hm-hdr-icons a.hm-search-toggle::before{content:none;margin:0}
.hm-trending-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:44px;padding:0;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.1)}#right-header .hm-trending-pill a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;line-height:1.2;position:relative}#right-header .hm-trending-pill a::after{content:"";background:#d00;border-radius:50%;height:14px;width:14px;z-index:2;animation:1s ease-in-out 0s normal none infinite running sk-scaleout;position:absolute;left:13px;top:50%;margin-top:-7px}
html.dark .hm-trending-pill{background:#2a3644}
html.dark #right-header .hm-hdr-icons .hm-dark-toggle,html.dark #right-header .hm-hdr-icons a.hm-search-toggle{color:var(--hm-text)}
/*BLGCHI001-C53: the footer-right tint stopped at the .in-footer 20px side padding, leaving a bare strip along the page's right edge (measured live on an 864px page: column right 844, footer right 864). The column now bleeds its own background to the page edge through a ::after strip -- background:inherit keeps the light/dark tints in step, and #footer-section's overflow:hidden clips the strip at the page edge (on mobile the column is already full-width, so the strip has zero visible width).*/
#footer-right{position:relative}
#footer-right::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:100%;width:100vw;background:inherit;pointer-events:none}
.hm-sk{display:block;background:var(--hm-border);border-radius:6px;animation:hm-sk-pulse 1.15s ease-in-out infinite}.hm-sk-hero{aspect-ratio:16/9;max-height:420px;border-radius:4px}.hm-sk-bar{height:14px;margin-top:10px}.hm-sk-bar-s{height:11px;max-width:52%;margin-top:10px}.hm-sk-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center}.hm-sk-thumb{flex:0 0 76px;width:76px;height:64px}.hm-sk-lines{flex:1;min-width:0}.hm-sk-lines .hm-sk-bar{margin-top:0}.hm-sk-lines .hm-sk-bar+.hm-sk-bar{margin-top:8px}
/*BLGCHI001-C324: page loader (B+C) -- 3px brand bar + skeleton veil over first paint; lifts on window load with a 4s fallback.*/
#hm-loader{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:99999}
.hm-loader-bar{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:3px;width:0;z-index:100000;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#3357a7,#1976d2 60%,#7ec8ff);box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(25,118,210,.8);transition:width .25s ease,opacity .4s ease}
.hm-loader-veil{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:99999;background:var(--hm-bg);padding:24px 16px;overflow:hidden;transition:opacity .4s ease}
.hm-loader-wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.hm-loader-head{height:74px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 20px;margin:-24px -16px 0}
.hm-loader-menu{width:44px;height:44px;flex:none;border-radius:50%}
.hm-loader-logo{width:294px;height:44px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:8px}
.hm-loader-acts{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
.hm-loader-act{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%}
.hm-loader-pill{width:110px;height:40px;border-radius:20px}
.hm-loader-nav{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:28px;height:46px;align-items:center}
.hm-loader-nav span{display:block;height:18px;border-radius:9px}
.hm-loader-ad{max-width:986px;height:143px;margin:20px auto 0}
.hm-loader-ad-in{height:127px;margin:8px}
.hm-loader-trend{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin:27px auto 0;max-width:1100px}
.hm-loader-tlabel{width:130px;flex:none}
.hm-loader-tlabel .hm-sk{display:block}
.hm-loader-tlabel .hm-sk+.hm-sk{margin-top:8px}
.hm-loader-tcircles{display:flex;gap:14px;flex:1;min-width:0}
.hm-loader-tcircle{width:88px;height:88px;flex:none;border-radius:50%}
.hm-loader-hline{width:220px;height:31px;margin:24px auto 15px;border-radius:4px}
.hm-loader-hero{height:495px}
.hm-loader-belt{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;margin-top:16px}
.hm-loader-feat{height:370px;border-radius:0}
.hm-loader-side{display:grid;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr}
.hm-loader-cell{min-height:0;border-radius:0}
.hm-loader-bottom{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}
.hm-loader-card{aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:0}
@media (max-width:767px){.hm-loader-wrap{padding:0}.hm-loader-head{height:62px}.hm-loader-logo{width:240px;height:36px}.hm-loader-acts .hm-loader-act,.hm-loader-acts .hm-loader-pill{display:none}.hm-loader-nav{display:none}.hm-loader-ad{max-width:none;margin:20px -16px 0;height:168px}.hm-loader-ad-in{height:152px}.hm-loader-trend{display:none}.hm-loader-hline{width:142px;height:32px}.hm-loader-hero{margin:0 -16px}.hm-loader-belt{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hm-loader-side{grid-template-rows:auto auto}.hm-loader-cell{height:92px}.hm-loader-bottom{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hm-loader-card{height:92px;aspect-ratio:auto}}
